title: ToadTutorialDialogue
---

<<change_camera_target DialogueManager SirThomasToad>>
<<disable_player_ui DialogueManager true>>

Toad: Hmm… These inscriptions seem to be on the older side, probably 400 years old… And these…
Toad: …hm?

//(Sir Thomas Toad turns around and notices the Green Soul)

<<flip_target DialogueManager SirThomasToad false>>

Toad: Whoa! Who are you?!

Toad: Or rather, what are you?

// (Sir Thomas Toad gets a closer look at the Green Soul)
<<move_target_to_position DialogueManager SirThomasToad -1.8 -2.02>>

Toad: Fascinating… You are not organic, are you?

Green Soul: …

Toad: Well, I guess I should not expect an organism composed of sand to be able to talk.

Toad: Can you understand what I say, at the very least? 

Green Soul: …

Toad: I’ll take your silence as confirmation for the time being.

Sir Thomas Toad: My name is Sir Thomas Toad, independent archaeologist. Came here to take a closer look at the ruins of this ancient civilization.

Sir Thomas Toad: I assume you are here for a similar reason?

Green Soul: …

Sir Thomas Toad: Well, if you indeed are, feel free to follow me. Some of the inscriptions deeper inside contain some truly fascinating information regarding the people who lived here.

Sir Thomas Toad: Hope to see you in a moment then!

//(Sir Thomas Toad walks deeper into the ruins)

<<enable_movement ToadInitialDialogueTrigger>>
<<disable_player_ui DialogueManager false>>
===
